WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.182 --> 00:00:03.349
(smooth, jazzy music)

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:08.438
- Don't talk to me before
I've had a sip of coffee.

00:00:08.438 --> 00:00:10.557
(ding)

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:13.290
The last person who talked
to me before I had coffee,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.187
(beep) Don't touch me before coffee.

00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:17.990
Went missing.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.573
Some people are scared
of me but, whatever.

00:00:23.134 --> 00:00:24.465
- A drink should be refreshing,

00:00:24.465 --> 00:00:26.439
it should be like ooh,
cool refreshing drink,

00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:28.399
not ow my mouth's on fire.

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:30.316
(ding)

00:00:31.368 --> 00:00:33.115
When it's hot I can walk around

00:00:33.115 --> 00:00:35.405
with my iced coffee and
no one will judge me,

00:00:35.405 --> 00:00:38.366
and when it's cold, people
are like what are you doing.

00:00:38.366 --> 00:00:39.199
I love it.

00:00:40.899 --> 00:00:42.686
- So I drink my coffee black.

00:00:42.686 --> 00:00:45.322
No, no sugar, no milk, no frill.

00:00:45.322 --> 00:00:47.923
(ding)

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.067
I just go to work.

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.309
Just very plain.

00:00:50.309 --> 00:00:51.818
Zero games on my phone.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:54.385
You know what I do, I read news.

00:00:54.385 --> 00:00:55.514
That's it.

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:56.794
(hissing)

00:00:56.794 --> 00:00:58.098
- I know everything about coffee,

00:00:58.098 --> 00:01:02.488
I am like the coffee
connoisseur, sommelier, so.

00:01:02.488 --> 00:01:03.875
Coffee's not easy, it's not simple.

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.954
(ding)

00:01:05.954 --> 00:01:09.414
I've been studying the art
of coffee for, (exhales)

00:01:09.414 --> 00:01:11.184
17 years now.

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:13.366
So we require all of our suppliers

00:01:13.366 --> 00:01:15.126
to pick the beans by feet.

00:01:15.126 --> 00:01:17.093
It just tastes, you'll notice it

00:01:17.093 --> 00:01:20.223
once you develop the coffee palate.

00:01:20.223 --> 00:01:22.851
Typically roasting just, in my experience,

00:01:22.851 --> 00:01:24.274
destroys the flavor of the bean,

00:01:24.274 --> 00:01:26.548
so we toast here, yeah.

00:01:26.548 --> 00:01:28.796
- Hi, may I please have an
iced grande iced coffee,

00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:30.561
no classic, with a little
bit of half and half?

00:01:30.561 --> 00:01:32.636
(ding)

00:01:32.636 --> 00:01:34.313
I mean yeah, people say
I'm a coffee addict,

00:01:34.313 --> 00:01:36.490
but I read the New York
Times, they say it's fine,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:37.916
like no one's proven
anything wrong with coffee,

00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:39.440
I don't think anything's
wrong with coffee.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.881
Hi again, iced grande
iced coffee, no classic,

00:01:41.881 --> 00:01:43.396
with a little bit of skim milk.

00:01:43.396 --> 00:01:44.902
About five sounds about normal a day,

00:01:44.902 --> 00:01:46.821
I mean this is, I'm up to three,

00:01:46.821 --> 00:01:48.008
so I think I could go up, you know,

00:01:48.008 --> 00:01:49.482
five is a good stopping point.

00:01:49.482 --> 00:01:51.224
Barista, regular?

00:01:51.224 --> 00:01:54.370
Yeah, I'll probably cut off around five.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:55.577
(dripping)

00:01:55.577 --> 00:01:57.985
- I'm more of a slow, easygoing person,

00:01:57.985 --> 00:02:00.266
and I'm just not trying to
be off the top all the time.

00:02:00.266 --> 00:02:02.210
(ding)

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.418
I mean yeah, a lot of older people

00:02:04.418 --> 00:02:06.170
drink decaffeinated coffee but I mean,

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.482
I guess I'm kinda like an old soul myself.

00:02:08.482 --> 00:02:09.898
I don't need help staying awake.

00:02:09.898 --> 00:02:11.826
I enjoy resting.

00:02:11.826 --> 00:02:13.338
I mean, isn't that normal?

00:02:13.338 --> 00:02:15.707
I never miss a night's sleep.

00:02:15.707 --> 00:02:16.874
Not with this.

00:02:18.409 --> 00:02:21.694
- I love coffee, but I don't
want to overpollute my body.

00:02:21.694 --> 00:02:23.401
(ding)

00:02:23.401 --> 00:02:25.553
Hi, I want an almond milk latte,

00:02:25.553 --> 00:02:27.747
how many calories is in that one?

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:30.348
For me it's really important
that the milk is organic.

00:02:30.348 --> 00:02:32.602
Almond milk, soy milk, hemp milk.

00:02:32.602 --> 00:02:35.139
I'm in the process of trying
to cleanse my body right now

00:02:35.139 --> 00:02:39.480
so I don't want to pollute it
with other unhealthy sugars.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.367
- Hi, can I have a large
French vanilla coffee

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:43.985
with lots of skim milk and three sugars?

00:02:43.985 --> 00:02:46.669
So I like the idea of coffee,

00:02:46.669 --> 00:02:49.810
but I need to have a lot of
milk in it, and a lot of sugar,

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.686
because I don't love the taste of it.

00:02:51.686 --> 00:02:53.791
(ding)

00:02:53.791 --> 00:02:56.830
Actually, can it just be
more of like a milkshake?

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.227
Just a little bit of
coffee in it, like a drop?

00:02:59.227 --> 00:03:00.934
It is not enough milk.

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:03.267
Let's pour out half of that.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.304
- I love coffee, but no more.

00:03:06.304 --> 00:03:08.904
Because, I've been getting a
lot of headaches and stuff.

00:03:08.904 --> 00:03:10.756
(ding)

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:12.923
I'm trying to quit coffee.

00:03:14.523 --> 00:03:16.091
It's been surprisingly hard.

00:03:16.091 --> 00:03:19.346
If I was drinking coffee
still, which I'm not, tea,

00:03:19.346 --> 00:03:21.031
I really like light roasts actually,

00:03:21.031 --> 00:03:23.323
because you don't know this,
and it's kinda counterintuitive

00:03:23.323 --> 00:03:25.853
but light roasts tend to
have more caffeine in them,

00:03:25.853 --> 00:03:28.276
so you'd be getting
more bang for your buck.

00:03:28.276 --> 00:03:29.203
Me?

00:03:29.203 --> 00:03:31.979
No, I, I don't miss coffee.

00:03:31.979 --> 00:03:34.479
If anything, coffee misses me.

00:03:36.704 --> 00:03:38.167
- [Black Coffee Drinker]
What are you drinking?

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:39.595
- [Other Woman] Oh, um, it's tea.

00:03:39.595 --> 00:03:41.041
- You're drinking tea?

00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:42.057
What are you even doing here?

00:03:42.057 --> 00:03:43.600
It's a coffee shop.

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.835
Get out of here.

